# Translation of the Museum of Alternative Displays into Català.
# How to work on this file: TRANSLATING.md at the top of the repository.
# 
# Catalan: central standard, IEC norm, the visitor addressed as "tu".
# A hall is an "àmbit" (a museum's word for a group of pieces that need not be a room), which leaves "sala" for the one room.
# "led" is written in lower case, with the plural "leds", as the IEC dictionary has it.
